usage: exp07_security_availability [-h]
                                   {info,plan,run-e7-block,run-e8-block,analyze,validate,inspect,missing-blocks,run-local}
                                   ...

Experiment 7 integrity and availability benchmark

positional arguments:
  {info,plan,run-e7-block,run-e8-block,analyze,validate,inspect,missing-blocks,run-local}
    info                probe Python and Ed25519 support
    plan                materialize deterministic E7 and E8 plans
    run-e7-block        execute one E7 Slurm block
    run-e8-block        execute one E8 Slurm block
    analyze             validate raw blocks and produce CSV/SVG results
    validate            verify result structure and SHA-256 manifest
    inspect             inspect E7 or E8 block completeness
    missing-blocks      print missing/corrupt array indices as a Slurm list
    run-local           execute a complete smoke/reference plan sequentially

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
